WEBVTT

00:31.630 --> 00:35.180
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:35.200 --> 00:38.580
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.850 --> 00:44.820
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.980 --> 00:49.610
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:49.630 --> 00:53.140
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:53.160 --> 00:56.650
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:56.670 --> 01:00.180
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

01:00.200 --> 01:06.260
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:19.520 --> 01:23.800
Si Jin

01:23.820 --> 01:27.800
Episode 30

01:27.800 --> 01:31.800
(Earl Dongping's Mansion)

01:31.800 --> 01:32.930
(Earl's Wife, Su Ke's Tablet)

01:32.930 --> 01:34.370
Now,

01:34.900 --> 01:37.530
the three of you swear

01:37.740 --> 01:39.780
on your mother's tablet

01:40.020 --> 01:41.980
that you'll never

01:42.210 --> 01:44.420
avenge her death

01:45.330 --> 01:47.780
on the Grand Princess.

01:48.930 --> 01:50.930
Do you hear me?

01:51.820 --> 01:53.260
No.

01:54.570 --> 01:56.280
Si has confirmed

01:56.300 --> 01:58.020
that she had Xiao

01:58.020 --> 01:59.650
kill our mother.

02:00.930 --> 02:02.580
As her son,

02:03.930 --> 02:05.530
I must avenge her death.

02:05.700 --> 02:07.370
- You fool!
- Zhan!

02:07.370 --> 02:09.580
Who do you think you are?

02:09.700 --> 02:12.220
What can you do to her?

02:14.180 --> 02:15.620
Father,

02:16.770 --> 02:18.900
I know you mean to protect us.

02:19.330 --> 02:21.580
The Grand Princess is too powerful.

02:23.090 --> 02:24.580
You fear

02:25.420 --> 02:27.720
we'll fail and end up dead,

02:27.740 --> 02:28.840
right?

02:28.860 --> 02:30.300
Yi,

02:31.980 --> 02:33.930
you're the eldest.

02:34.090 --> 02:36.120
You're also a parent.

02:36.140 --> 02:37.620
You know better than anyone

02:37.620 --> 02:40.340
how I feel as your father.

02:40.900 --> 02:42.340
Right now,

02:42.770 --> 02:45.020
if your daughter, Yan,

02:45.020 --> 02:46.350
were in danger,

02:46.370 --> 02:48.770
wouldn't you protect her

02:48.770 --> 02:50.750
at all costs?

02:50.770 --> 02:52.970
I don't want anything

02:53.090 --> 02:55.050
but the three of you

02:55.050 --> 02:59.020
living in peace for the rest of your lives.

02:59.210 --> 03:00.140
Back then,

03:00.140 --> 03:02.460
I failed to protect your mother.

03:03.420 --> 03:04.860
Now,

03:05.090 --> 03:07.210
whatever it takes,

03:07.210 --> 03:10.580
I can't put you in harm's way!

03:11.330 --> 03:13.090
Swear to me now.

03:16.980 --> 03:18.420
Fine.

03:19.860 --> 03:21.280
I swear to you.

03:21.300 --> 03:22.740
Yi!

03:23.090 --> 03:24.120
You've

03:24.140 --> 03:27.090
always been the most obedient.

03:28.140 --> 03:30.230
I never need to worry about you.

03:30.250 --> 03:31.350
Father!

03:31.370 --> 03:32.630
If you

03:32.650 --> 03:33.860
insist on

03:33.860 --> 03:36.120
risking your life for revenge,

03:36.140 --> 03:39.310
then get out of this house.

03:39.330 --> 03:40.770
And your name

03:40.810 --> 03:43.530
will be removed from our pedigree.

03:46.020 --> 03:47.780
I, Jiang Ancheng...

03:49.090 --> 03:50.850
I, Jiang Ancheng,

03:51.050 --> 03:53.600
will no longer see you as my son.

03:53.620 --> 03:55.060
Father!

03:55.330 --> 03:57.620
If you still think I'm your father,

03:58.250 --> 04:00.970
swear to me right now.

04:07.980 --> 04:09.420
Fine.

04:15.300 --> 04:16.850
I won't take revenge

04:18.540 --> 04:20.090
or stir up trouble.

04:22.050 --> 04:23.650
Happy now?

04:25.100 --> 04:26.970
Are you happy now?

04:38.740 --> 04:40.180
Si,

04:41.340 --> 04:43.780
Zhan and Yi have sworn to me.

04:44.300 --> 04:45.740
Will you?

04:55.860 --> 04:57.300
Father,

04:58.130 --> 04:59.810
do you really think we'll be safe

04:59.810 --> 05:01.610
by letting go of the past?

05:01.810 --> 05:03.620
My mother compromised over and over,

05:03.620 --> 05:04.490
suffering in silence,

05:04.490 --> 05:06.960
but did the Grand Princess spare her?

05:06.980 --> 05:08.930
Now that we know who killed her,

05:08.930 --> 05:10.220
why can't we take revenge?

05:10.220 --> 05:11.220
How can we let the killer

05:11.220 --> 05:12.760
get away and enjoy her life?

05:12.780 --> 05:14.520
I won't swear to you

05:14.540 --> 05:16.490
no matter what.

05:17.340 --> 05:18.540
Whether you'll remove my name

05:18.540 --> 05:20.200
from our pedigree

05:20.220 --> 05:22.260
or kick me out of our house,

05:22.660 --> 05:24.450
I swear revenge on the killer.

05:24.450 --> 05:25.620
The Grand Princess must pay

05:25.620 --> 05:26.540
with blood!

05:26.540 --> 05:28.410
Shut up!

05:28.570 --> 05:29.760
Si!

05:29.780 --> 05:32.820
- Father...
- You're too young.

05:33.740 --> 05:34.740
You have no idea

05:34.740 --> 05:37.670
about the Grand Princess's might.

05:37.690 --> 05:40.930
She's favored by His Majesty

05:40.930 --> 05:43.180
who's the only one above her.

05:43.180 --> 05:45.990
There's no way we can bring her down.

05:46.010 --> 05:47.420
Little strokes fell great oaks!

05:47.420 --> 05:48.540
We haven't even tried.

05:48.540 --> 05:49.890
How do you know we can't?

05:49.890 --> 05:51.410
What will you do?

05:51.860 --> 05:53.940
What can you do?

05:55.010 --> 05:56.700
File a suit to His Majesty?

05:56.860 --> 05:58.450
Before you can beat the drum

05:58.450 --> 05:59.840
outside the court,

05:59.860 --> 06:01.890
she's cooked up

06:01.890 --> 06:02.980
tons of charges against you

06:02.980 --> 06:05.450
without lifting a finger.

06:05.450 --> 06:07.760
Or will you poison her as well

06:07.780 --> 06:08.870
or assassinate her?

06:08.890 --> 06:12.100
You know you're weak and delicate.

06:12.100 --> 06:15.290
Will you succeed?

06:15.490 --> 06:17.020
Si,

06:17.050 --> 06:18.740
how else should I put it

06:18.740 --> 06:21.460
to make you give up?

06:23.490 --> 06:25.170
Father...

06:27.200 --> 06:28.130
Father...

06:28.130 --> 06:29.700
I've...

06:29.860 --> 06:32.940
I've lost your mother.

06:33.860 --> 06:37.380
I cannot lose you either.

06:41.780 --> 06:44.340
I can't!

07:09.620 --> 07:10.910
Father.

07:10.930 --> 07:12.580
Come here, Jin.

07:13.050 --> 07:14.870
Let's see who will win.

07:14.890 --> 07:16.330
Sure.

07:27.010 --> 07:28.450
Jin,

07:29.250 --> 07:30.890
Supervisor Yang of Astronomy

07:30.890 --> 07:33.430
handed in a report yesterday.

07:33.450 --> 07:34.550
He asserted

07:34.570 --> 07:36.180
that if you married a girl

07:36.180 --> 07:38.600
who was born a jinx,

07:38.620 --> 07:40.060
it'd harm

07:40.180 --> 07:42.220
our family and state.

07:42.420 --> 07:43.640
Dazhou would be in chaos.

07:43.660 --> 07:45.100
Do you believe that?

07:50.810 --> 07:52.780
All the officials do.

07:52.930 --> 07:55.490
Water can carry a boat but also overturn it.

07:55.740 --> 07:57.900
Although an emperor is above everyone,

07:58.250 --> 08:00.960
he can't shut all of them up.

08:00.980 --> 08:02.420
Jin,

08:02.890 --> 08:04.320
if disasters happen,

08:04.340 --> 08:06.180
I don't want others

08:06.180 --> 08:08.030
to pin everything on you again.

08:08.050 --> 08:09.760
The one who was "born a jinx"

08:09.780 --> 08:11.650
as Supervisor Yang said

08:11.810 --> 08:13.490
was Jiang Si, right?

08:13.740 --> 08:14.690
Yes.

08:14.690 --> 08:16.850
You've issued the edict of betrothal.

08:17.420 --> 08:18.870
You can't take that back.

08:18.890 --> 08:21.270
By Supervisor Yang's calculation,

08:21.290 --> 08:23.220
Cui Mingyue's date of birth

08:23.250 --> 08:25.300
complements Jiang Si's.

08:25.370 --> 08:27.540
If you marry them both,

08:27.820 --> 08:31.300
it'll neutralize the harm.

08:32.220 --> 08:34.230
I've asked the Grand Princess.

08:34.250 --> 08:35.840
She'll marry Mingyue to you

08:35.860 --> 08:38.390
for the greater good.

08:38.410 --> 08:40.130
But I won't marry her.

08:40.890 --> 08:42.680
Mingyue is a Commandery Princess.

08:42.700 --> 08:44.420
In terms of status,

08:44.650 --> 08:47.660
she's a better match than Jiang Si.

08:47.770 --> 08:50.700
Father, I've made my decision.

08:51.700 --> 08:53.370
Why bring trouble on myself?

08:54.860 --> 08:57.350
Jiang Si is what my heart yearns for

08:57.370 --> 08:58.970
and belongs to.

09:02.490 --> 09:04.290
Go home and think it over.

09:04.290 --> 09:05.370
Then tell me your decision.

09:05.370 --> 09:07.080
I don't need more time to think.

09:07.100 --> 09:09.200
This is my decision.

09:09.220 --> 09:11.460
Father, if there's nothing else,

09:12.530 --> 09:14.970
I shall take my leave.

09:23.740 --> 09:25.770
If I allowed

09:25.890 --> 09:27.560
other princes

09:27.580 --> 09:30.180
to marry two girls together,

09:30.410 --> 09:33.220
they couldn't thank me enough for that.

09:34.890 --> 09:37.610
What a stubborn mule.

09:43.860 --> 09:47.460
I know I'm guilty.

09:47.820 --> 09:51.010
I've knelt for a day and a night

09:51.060 --> 09:53.990
without eating anything.

09:54.010 --> 09:56.250
Your Highness,

09:56.290 --> 09:59.580
please spare me.

10:04.410 --> 10:06.540
When you were little,

10:07.410 --> 10:09.300
you'd cry in your sleep.

10:09.530 --> 10:11.440
I had to hold you

10:11.460 --> 10:14.340
every night to comfort you.

10:14.580 --> 10:16.270
Before you turned three,

10:16.290 --> 10:19.250
I hadn't had one good night's sleep.

10:19.820 --> 10:22.110
That's why I tended to

10:22.130 --> 10:24.010
sleep a lot afterward.

10:24.170 --> 10:27.440
I'm too old.

10:27.460 --> 10:29.580
They beat gongs and drums

10:29.580 --> 10:31.540
to keep me from dozing off.

10:31.580 --> 10:34.370
I couldn't take it anymore

10:34.620 --> 10:38.130
and let it slip!

10:40.340 --> 10:43.060
How have I treated you these years?

10:44.060 --> 10:46.200
However many people in this house

10:46.220 --> 10:48.540
told me you overreached yourself,

10:49.130 --> 10:52.060
I ignored them and tolerated you.

10:52.290 --> 10:54.890
How dare you betray me!

10:54.890 --> 10:56.720
Spare me, Your Highness!

10:56.740 --> 10:58.530
I only said

10:58.530 --> 10:59.530
Su Ke

10:59.530 --> 11:02.040
was flirtatious and seductive

11:02.060 --> 11:03.270
in front of men.

11:03.290 --> 11:04.970
Being poisoned

11:05.010 --> 11:06.510
to death

11:06.530 --> 11:07.410
was her karma.

11:07.410 --> 11:09.110
Did you tell them about Nanwu?

11:10.770 --> 11:12.210
I wouldn't dare

11:12.770 --> 11:14.010
say a word about it.

11:14.010 --> 11:16.540
Your Highness, I have news for you.

11:16.650 --> 11:18.090
Come in.

11:18.820 --> 11:20.260
Your Highness,

11:20.410 --> 11:22.680
Prince Yan refused His Majesty's offer.

11:22.700 --> 11:24.730
He wouldn't marry Princess Mingyue.

11:28.650 --> 11:31.410
(Graceful and Dignified)
I admire loyal couples the most.

11:31.980 --> 11:34.460
They won't have their way.

11:35.250 --> 11:36.750
If Jiang Si

11:36.770 --> 11:38.010
refuses to die of poison

11:38.010 --> 11:40.130
like Su Ke,

11:41.250 --> 11:43.230
we'll do something else.

11:43.250 --> 11:44.890
Yes, Your Highness.

11:45.170 --> 11:46.680
After leaving the Palace yesterday,

11:46.700 --> 11:47.610
Prince Yan went to find

11:47.610 --> 11:49.230
those two officials of Astronomy.

11:49.250 --> 11:50.650
Luckily, we had silenced those two

11:50.650 --> 11:52.420
beforehand.

11:52.530 --> 11:54.250
That was wise of you.

11:57.820 --> 12:00.010
Did you leak it?

12:00.580 --> 12:01.840
Otherwise,

12:01.860 --> 12:04.440
he wouldn't have gone to check overnight.

12:04.460 --> 12:06.770
I accidentally

12:06.820 --> 12:07.740
told his guard

12:07.740 --> 12:09.370
about 20 years ago.

12:09.370 --> 12:10.370
That was all my fault!

12:10.370 --> 12:11.970
Useless!

12:12.460 --> 12:15.370
I'm sorry, Your Highness!

12:15.370 --> 12:18.090
I deserve death!

12:20.980 --> 12:22.490
Wait... Your Highness,

12:23.170 --> 12:25.510
the dead can't talk.

12:25.530 --> 12:27.580
What I said

12:28.170 --> 12:29.720
is also vague.

12:29.740 --> 12:32.200
Prince Yan can't find any evidence.

12:32.220 --> 12:34.130
He won't report you

12:34.130 --> 12:35.850
to His Majesty.

12:36.170 --> 12:37.730
I dare him!

12:38.490 --> 12:40.580
Brother has so many children.

12:40.890 --> 12:42.740
He didn't even grow up in the Palace.

12:42.740 --> 12:44.150
He's a nobody.

12:44.170 --> 12:46.220
How dare he report me!

12:48.370 --> 12:50.220
The dead can't talk.

12:51.370 --> 12:54.060
Actually, you remind me of that.

12:54.490 --> 12:55.930
Servant.

13:02.370 --> 13:03.810
What now?

13:03.980 --> 13:05.870
You refuse to drink

13:05.890 --> 13:07.420
the tea from me?

13:21.530 --> 13:22.800
Your Highness,

13:22.820 --> 13:26.060
your arm was once injured.

13:26.410 --> 13:29.580
Other servants can be clumsy.

13:30.100 --> 13:34.340
If you aren't used to their service,

13:34.580 --> 13:36.990
and you'd rather have me instead,

13:37.010 --> 13:40.770
my life is worth it.

13:58.820 --> 14:01.220
What are you talking about?

14:01.370 --> 14:03.250
You breastfed me.

14:03.410 --> 14:06.090
I'll give you another chance, of course.

14:07.170 --> 14:08.740
Yesterday, if you believed

14:08.740 --> 14:10.290
I'd kill you for sure

14:10.290 --> 14:12.420
and didn't come back with me,

14:13.820 --> 14:15.420
you'd become

14:15.650 --> 14:19.010
one of the dead who couldn't talk.

14:22.130 --> 14:24.940
The tea is a reward and punishment.

14:25.100 --> 14:26.920
Next time,

14:26.940 --> 14:29.320
however soft I am,

14:29.340 --> 14:30.630
I will not spare you.

14:30.650 --> 14:33.970
Thanks for your mercy, Your Highness!

14:35.010 --> 14:36.590
When I was alone in the room with Ms. Xu,

14:36.590 --> 14:37.070
she let slip

14:37.070 --> 14:38.140
that the Grand Princess had

14:38.140 --> 14:39.340
tried to ruin you 20 years ago.

14:39.340 --> 14:40.780
20 years ago?

14:41.770 --> 14:42.770
When I was called cursed

14:42.770 --> 14:44.440
by the Directorate of Astronomy?

14:44.460 --> 14:45.910
Was that her doing?

14:45.930 --> 14:46.820
By the way, Chief,

14:46.820 --> 14:47.810
Mr. Xiao's letter arrived

14:47.810 --> 14:49.580
from Lingshui earlier today.

14:54.490 --> 14:58.060
"Observer Jiang Ancheng also knows."

15:00.160 --> 15:03.160
(Jiang)

15:17.620 --> 15:19.060
(Father, )

15:19.860 --> 15:21.740
(do you really think we'll be safe)

15:21.740 --> 15:23.340
(by letting go of the past?)

15:23.530 --> 15:25.370
(My mother compromised over and over, )

15:25.370 --> 15:26.290
(suffering in silence, )

15:26.290 --> 15:28.820
(but did the Grand Princess spare her?)

15:30.980 --> 15:32.980
(Now that we know who killed her, )

15:32.980 --> 15:34.390
(why can't we take revenge?)

15:34.410 --> 15:35.460
(How can we let the killer)

15:35.460 --> 15:37.130
(get away and enjoy her life?)

15:49.100 --> 15:50.580
- Your Highness.
- Sir.

15:51.170 --> 15:52.920
Why did you ask to see me

15:52.940 --> 15:54.320
this late, sir?

15:54.340 --> 15:56.060
Please have a seat.

16:03.620 --> 16:05.350
Do you know

16:05.370 --> 16:07.350
I disapprove of Si

16:07.370 --> 16:08.990
marrying you?

16:09.010 --> 16:10.390
I do.

16:10.410 --> 16:12.390
I hoped that she'd

16:12.410 --> 16:15.180
lead a peaceful life.

16:15.620 --> 16:17.150
Even if

16:17.170 --> 16:18.990
it'd be ordinary,

16:19.010 --> 16:19.850
I didn't want her...

16:19.860 --> 16:21.860
I know you don't want her to be involved

16:21.860 --> 16:23.660
in power struggle.

16:23.890 --> 16:25.330
Neither do I.

16:27.770 --> 16:29.560
There is something

16:29.580 --> 16:32.200
I've kept to myself for years.

16:32.220 --> 16:34.870
No one else knows.

16:34.890 --> 16:36.390
I'm afraid

16:36.410 --> 16:40.150
it greatly concerns you.

16:40.170 --> 16:41.740
20 years ago,

16:41.740 --> 16:44.340
I was an official in Astronomy.

16:44.340 --> 16:45.780
I know that.

16:46.820 --> 16:48.060
I've talked to Mr. Chu

16:48.060 --> 16:49.390
and Mr. Xiao.

16:49.410 --> 16:50.510
I was wondering

16:50.530 --> 16:52.510
how I should bring that up,

16:52.530 --> 16:54.040
and here you are

16:54.060 --> 16:56.220
being candid about it.

16:56.690 --> 16:58.110
Alright then.

16:58.130 --> 17:00.220
I'll cut to the chase.

17:02.730 --> 17:06.420
You weren't born cursed.

17:07.300 --> 17:08.910
On the contrary,

17:08.930 --> 17:10.150
that night,

17:10.170 --> 17:11.730
when I observed the sky,

17:11.730 --> 17:14.660
it showed a great omen!

17:17.210 --> 17:19.050
In the 3rd year of Jingming,

17:19.130 --> 17:21.250
on the 5th day of the 5th month...

17:25.100 --> 17:26.520
Mr. Jiang,

17:26.540 --> 17:29.000
(Astronomy)
the sky seems abnormal tonight.

17:29.020 --> 17:32.110
Supervisor Yang sent us to take your shift.

17:32.130 --> 17:33.320
You may come down.

17:33.340 --> 17:34.300
Gentlemen,

17:34.300 --> 17:36.390
(Astronomy)
here's my observation tonight.

17:36.410 --> 17:39.290
I think it's a great omen!

17:39.410 --> 17:41.320
It's not the time yet.

17:41.340 --> 17:42.890
You've stayed up all night.

17:42.890 --> 17:44.210
Go back and rest.

17:44.210 --> 17:45.350
Sure.

17:45.370 --> 17:47.810
I'll take my leave then.

17:48.340 --> 17:49.560
Mr. Xiao,

17:49.580 --> 17:51.340
why would the Grand Princess brand

17:51.340 --> 17:53.170
a newborn prince a cursed boy?

17:53.170 --> 17:54.160
(In the 3rd...)
You know

17:54.160 --> 17:55.860
(North Star...)
what happened in the South?

17:55.860 --> 17:57.560
Nanwu invaded our border.

17:57.580 --> 17:59.210
(...a great omen.)
Our garrison suffered

17:59.210 --> 18:00.970
the worst defeat ever.

18:01.650 --> 18:04.370
But what was that to do

18:04.370 --> 18:05.600
with that prince?

18:05.620 --> 18:08.950
Their commander is Cui Xu.

18:08.970 --> 18:10.620
The Grand Princess's husband?

18:10.620 --> 18:11.930
The prince's mother, Consort Xian,

18:11.930 --> 18:13.910
will soon become a Noble Consort.

18:13.930 --> 18:15.410
The Grand Princess

18:15.410 --> 18:16.800
cannot allow it.

18:16.820 --> 18:18.180
A cursed prince will be

18:18.190 --> 18:20.060
a heavy blow to Consort Xian

18:20.060 --> 18:21.860
and help Cui Xu out,

18:22.020 --> 18:23.810
killing two birds with one stone.

18:26.260 --> 18:28.260
I can't believe that in order to

18:28.260 --> 18:30.420
prevent Cui Xu from being punished

18:30.540 --> 18:32.340
and my mother from being promoted,

18:32.340 --> 18:33.730
the Grand Princess

18:33.730 --> 18:36.040
reversed my fate!

18:36.060 --> 18:40.180
I feel guilty about it.

18:40.620 --> 18:41.950
Back then,

18:41.970 --> 18:44.630
I was too afraid of the Grand Princess

18:44.650 --> 18:46.060
to bring her scheme to light

18:46.060 --> 18:47.540
or tell the truth

18:47.540 --> 18:49.480
to uphold justice.

18:49.500 --> 18:51.620
Now, I'm cornered.

18:51.970 --> 18:54.800
They've killed my wife.

18:54.820 --> 18:56.580
Si is their next target.

18:56.580 --> 18:58.020
Sir,

18:58.300 --> 19:00.100
she doesn't want you to get involved

19:00.100 --> 19:01.730
in this mess either.

19:02.340 --> 19:04.100
I'll find the evidence

19:04.130 --> 19:05.480
against the culprit myself.

19:05.500 --> 19:06.630
Your Highness,

19:06.650 --> 19:08.760
the Annal of Divination
for the year you were born

19:08.780 --> 19:10.810
can be the evidence.

19:11.170 --> 19:15.080
As much as I feared to be in trouble,

19:15.100 --> 19:16.280
I didn't want the truth

19:16.300 --> 19:18.970
to be buried forever.

19:20.650 --> 19:22.390
(That explains why Father)

19:22.410 --> 19:23.340
(tried to stop me)

19:23.340 --> 19:24.970
(from marrying Yu Qi.)

19:26.240 --> 19:33.240
(Majesty and Prestige)

19:33.260 --> 19:35.620
The Grand Princess planted

19:35.620 --> 19:37.000
spies into the harem.

19:37.020 --> 19:38.560
She must've been prepared.

19:38.580 --> 19:40.250
Your safety comes first.

19:40.690 --> 19:42.630
Be careful when you gather information.

19:42.650 --> 19:43.840
You too.

19:43.860 --> 19:44.950
The Directorate of Astronomy

19:44.950 --> 19:46.100
is tough to deal with.

19:46.100 --> 19:47.130
What the divination was

19:47.130 --> 19:48.520
when you were born

19:48.540 --> 19:50.220
will be found out eventually.

19:50.930 --> 19:52.770
Don't act rashly

19:53.100 --> 19:54.540
or risk your life.

19:55.540 --> 19:56.460
I know.

19:56.460 --> 19:59.430
(Tiande Hall)

19:59.450 --> 20:00.450
Ever since His Majesty

20:00.450 --> 20:02.620
issued the edict of betrothal,

20:02.780 --> 20:04.210
Jin has become a laughingstock

20:04.210 --> 20:06.110
in the entire harem.

20:06.130 --> 20:07.600
They say he's uncultured

20:07.620 --> 20:09.060
as he grew up in the South.

20:09.060 --> 20:10.100
He's ignorant,

20:10.100 --> 20:12.460
short-sighted, and simple-minded.

20:12.860 --> 20:14.810
I'm furious!

20:16.620 --> 20:18.220
Please calm down.

20:18.860 --> 20:22.700
Mother, I'm not sure

20:22.890 --> 20:24.320
if I should say this.

20:24.340 --> 20:25.710
Out with it.

20:25.730 --> 20:27.150
Don't be bashful.

20:27.170 --> 20:29.060
Miss Jiang Si is

20:29.060 --> 20:31.010
really something else.

20:31.100 --> 20:33.710
She outshone all the girls,

20:33.730 --> 20:36.140
including Princess Mingyue, at the banquet.

20:36.450 --> 20:37.650
Even Father was

20:37.650 --> 20:39.530
impressed by her.

20:39.930 --> 20:42.480
To think if she disobeys you

20:42.500 --> 20:46.180
while Prince Yan takes her side...

20:47.260 --> 20:49.420
How is she my match?

20:49.780 --> 20:51.950
You, go to Earl Dongping's Mansion.

20:51.970 --> 20:54.110
Summon her to the Jinhua Hall

20:54.130 --> 20:55.670
to be lectured.

20:55.690 --> 20:57.130
Yes.

20:58.450 --> 20:59.840
Your Highness,

20:59.860 --> 21:02.190
Miss Si is right outside

21:02.210 --> 21:04.100
to pay her respects to you.

21:06.500 --> 21:07.760
Perfect timing.

21:07.780 --> 21:08.910
Send her in.

21:08.930 --> 21:09.820
Yes.

21:09.820 --> 21:10.890
I'm here as the Commandant

21:10.890 --> 21:12.520
of Capital Security

21:12.540 --> 21:13.620
to check

21:13.620 --> 21:15.190
certain files in your archives.

21:15.210 --> 21:17.100
Please be cooperative, Mr. Yang.

21:17.370 --> 21:18.910
(Astronomy)
Prince Yan,

21:18.930 --> 21:20.760
all our archives have been

21:20.780 --> 21:23.140
stored in the warehouse.

21:23.340 --> 21:25.010
To access them,

21:25.170 --> 21:26.480
you'll need

21:26.500 --> 21:27.650
a reading permit

21:27.650 --> 21:29.380
with His Majesty's seal.

21:29.580 --> 21:31.020
Of course.

21:38.020 --> 21:39.670
As far as I remember,

21:39.690 --> 21:40.650
this reading permit

21:40.650 --> 21:41.780
was granted

21:41.800 --> 21:42.650
when you and Mr. Zhen

21:42.650 --> 21:44.520
investigated the Hunt Case, right?

21:44.540 --> 21:45.800
There are unanswered questions,

21:45.820 --> 21:47.650
requiring further investigation. Problem?

21:47.650 --> 21:49.390
His Majesty is fair and just.

21:49.410 --> 21:50.370
The Directorate

21:50.370 --> 21:52.560
has dismissed those involved in that case.

21:52.580 --> 21:54.100
What else

21:54.170 --> 21:55.520
needs to be investigated?

21:55.540 --> 21:58.060
- Has the permit expired?
- Not yet.

21:58.060 --> 21:59.410
- Has the case closed?
- Not yet.

21:59.410 --> 22:01.130
Your persistent hindrance makes you

22:01.130 --> 22:02.170
look guilty, Mr. Yang.

22:02.170 --> 22:03.210
Looks like

22:03.210 --> 22:05.570
I have to report everything to His Majesty.

22:10.100 --> 22:11.620
- Please.
- Thanks.

22:11.640 --> 22:13.520
(Astronomy)
Uh, Chief.

22:13.540 --> 22:15.130
My stomach hurts all of a sudden.

22:15.130 --> 22:16.570
Show him, Mr. Yang.

22:17.300 --> 22:18.320
Go straight.

22:18.340 --> 22:19.780
Thanks, Mr. Yang.

22:22.130 --> 22:24.040
Jiang Si of Earl Dongping's Mansion

22:24.060 --> 22:25.760
greets you, Your Highness.

22:25.780 --> 22:28.420
May you live long and prosper.

22:28.580 --> 22:29.540
Miss Si,

22:29.540 --> 22:31.560
when paying your respects for the first time,

22:31.580 --> 22:34.240
(Ms. Lin)
you should also kowtow.

22:34.650 --> 22:36.940
Didn't your family teach you that?

22:43.540 --> 22:45.220
My apologies.

22:49.450 --> 22:51.280
I greet you, Your Highness.

22:51.300 --> 22:53.730
May you live long and prosper.

23:04.540 --> 23:06.330
Your manner

23:06.860 --> 23:08.660
doesn't look too bad.

23:11.060 --> 23:12.730
Thanks, Your Highness.

23:16.370 --> 23:19.250
Her Highness hasn't allowed you up.

23:19.410 --> 23:22.050
Listen to her lecture on your knees.

23:32.650 --> 23:34.090
Yes.

23:35.060 --> 23:36.710
I heard

23:36.730 --> 23:38.970
your mother was from a house of merchants.

23:39.130 --> 23:42.910
As humble as Earl Dongping's Mansion is,

23:42.930 --> 23:45.290
your ancestors were noble

23:45.410 --> 23:47.630
with ranks.

23:47.650 --> 23:49.950
How did they let your mother in?

23:49.970 --> 23:51.420
Or

23:51.820 --> 23:54.240
did you learn from her

23:54.260 --> 23:56.290
about how to marry up?

23:58.890 --> 24:00.660
Your Highness,

24:00.730 --> 24:02.560
I lost my mother

24:02.580 --> 24:04.220
when I was born.

24:04.370 --> 24:06.250
Although I was unable to

24:06.300 --> 24:08.330
grow up with her,

24:08.500 --> 24:10.630
I heard a lot from others

24:10.650 --> 24:12.760
about her virtue

24:12.780 --> 24:14.040
and integrity.

24:14.060 --> 24:16.080
She's my role model.

24:16.100 --> 24:18.110
Compared with those who lived

24:18.130 --> 24:19.670
but abandoned their children

24:19.690 --> 24:21.700
and taught them nothing,

24:21.780 --> 24:22.860
my mother is much better.

24:22.860 --> 24:24.110
How dare you

24:24.130 --> 24:26.320
make such insinuating remarks against me!

24:26.340 --> 24:29.420
Slap her!

24:36.450 --> 24:38.330
Are the rest of you dead? Go!

24:40.730 --> 24:42.170
Let me go!

24:44.210 --> 24:45.100
Mother,

24:45.100 --> 24:46.870
this is only her first visit to the Palace.

24:46.890 --> 24:48.100
Please show mercy

24:48.100 --> 24:49.670
and spare her this time.

24:49.690 --> 24:51.280
If she gets hurt,

24:51.300 --> 24:53.810
Prince Jin will be worried and mad.

24:53.930 --> 24:56.810
It might ruin the bond between you two.

25:05.060 --> 25:06.660
Slap her!

25:18.130 --> 25:20.140
If I hadn't vented my anger,

25:20.580 --> 25:21.860
I probably wouldn't have made it

25:21.860 --> 25:23.970
to the day we bonded.

25:24.340 --> 25:25.670
Ms. Lin.

25:25.690 --> 25:26.540
Yes.

25:26.540 --> 25:27.840
First, Jiang Si was

25:27.860 --> 25:30.390
betrothed to Duke An's heir.

25:30.410 --> 25:32.900
Then she and the Zhen Clan were close.

25:33.620 --> 25:35.040
You

25:35.060 --> 25:36.660
shall check her

25:37.450 --> 25:40.240
thoroughly for me

25:40.260 --> 25:41.170
to see

25:41.170 --> 25:44.350
if she's still a virgin.

25:44.370 --> 25:45.370
Your Highness,

25:45.370 --> 25:46.870
you can't insult me like that!

25:46.890 --> 25:48.330
Princess Qi!

25:48.930 --> 25:50.370
Let go of me!

25:56.210 --> 25:58.900
Don't be mad, Mother.

26:01.650 --> 26:03.000
Her mother had died years ago.

26:03.020 --> 26:04.660
Why didn't you tell me that?

26:05.820 --> 26:08.620
Did you mean to give her a chance

26:08.620 --> 26:10.620
to mock me?

26:11.500 --> 26:14.570
I apologize for my negligence.

26:15.020 --> 26:16.370
Let go of me!

26:16.390 --> 26:17.250
Let go...!

26:17.260 --> 26:19.490
Gag her already!

26:20.930 --> 26:22.370
Don't touch me,

26:22.500 --> 26:24.420
or Prince Yan will make you pay!

26:26.170 --> 26:28.130
Have you lost your virginity?

26:28.130 --> 26:29.810
Are you afraid we'll find out,

26:30.060 --> 26:32.130
so you're threatening us with your life?

26:33.370 --> 26:35.570
- Seize her!
- Step back!

26:35.650 --> 26:37.090
Tell them to leave.

26:40.580 --> 26:42.020
Do as I say!

26:42.930 --> 26:44.370
Get out!

26:47.130 --> 26:49.180
Ms. Lin, before you check me,

26:50.300 --> 26:52.330
feel that cut in your palm.

26:52.730 --> 26:54.290
It hurts badly, huh?

26:54.370 --> 26:55.810
Is it

26:56.020 --> 26:58.050
also getting itchy?

27:00.060 --> 27:01.570
What did you do to me?

27:03.130 --> 27:05.460
You must've heard

27:05.730 --> 27:07.280
that at the banquet,

27:07.300 --> 27:09.490
I had recognized the Traceless Grass

27:09.580 --> 27:12.330
and made flowers bloom instantly.

27:13.620 --> 27:14.720
If I could've done all that,

27:14.720 --> 27:16.460
I could've certainly

27:18.630 --> 27:20.290
smeared poison on this shard.

27:24.100 --> 27:25.130
You're bluffing.

27:25.130 --> 27:26.570
Am I?

27:26.730 --> 27:28.220
Believe it or not,

27:28.860 --> 27:30.770
if you don't take the antidote

27:30.890 --> 27:33.100
before the sunset,

27:33.500 --> 27:34.800
tonight, you'll bleed

27:34.820 --> 27:37.380
from the seven holes in your head and die.

27:37.650 --> 27:39.420
You'll die

27:39.500 --> 27:41.100
a horrible death.

27:50.100 --> 27:51.540
Miss Si,

27:51.580 --> 27:52.930
even if I'm coerced

27:52.930 --> 27:54.530
into covering for you today,

27:54.580 --> 27:57.290
Prince Yan will find out
on your wedding night.

27:58.100 --> 28:00.570
My virginity won't be your concern.

28:01.780 --> 28:03.250
Alright, fine.

28:03.410 --> 28:05.650
I know what to say to Her Highness.

28:06.410 --> 28:08.040
Give me the antidote now.

28:08.060 --> 28:09.240
Miss Si!

28:09.260 --> 28:10.940
That can wait.

28:11.410 --> 28:12.850
Ms. Lin,

28:12.970 --> 28:14.980
you've been in the Palace for decades.

28:15.060 --> 28:16.900
I'd like to ask you something.

28:19.100 --> 28:20.280
Ask away.

28:20.300 --> 28:22.070
I'll tell you everything I know.

28:22.170 --> 28:23.900
Which lady is

28:24.170 --> 28:25.890
Grand Princess Rongyang the closest to

28:25.890 --> 28:27.150
in the harem?

28:27.170 --> 28:28.700
Consort Zhuang

28:28.890 --> 28:30.350
and Empress Di.

28:30.370 --> 28:31.810
Empress Di?

28:31.940 --> 28:32.780
That's right.

28:32.780 --> 28:34.700
After Empress Qingrong passed away,

28:35.050 --> 28:35.930
the Grand Princess

28:35.930 --> 28:38.110
nominated her first to be the next empress.

28:41.170 --> 28:43.190
Do Consort Zhuang and Empress Di

28:43.210 --> 28:44.060
have senior maids

28:44.060 --> 28:46.000
who have served for almost 20 years?

28:46.650 --> 28:47.970
I don't know exactly

28:47.970 --> 28:50.100
how long their maids have served,

28:51.500 --> 28:53.390
but the ones by their sides

28:53.410 --> 28:55.380
are senior to the others.

28:56.020 --> 28:58.330
Why do you ask?

28:58.410 --> 29:00.460
Please give me the antidote!

29:00.970 --> 29:01.890
Please, Miss!

29:01.890 --> 29:02.730
Be patient.

29:02.730 --> 29:04.320
Once I get out of the Jinhua Hall,

29:04.340 --> 29:05.660
you'll have it.

29:05.680 --> 29:09.160
(Prince Yan's Mansion)

29:18.690 --> 29:20.040
Mother!

29:20.060 --> 29:21.390
Qian.

29:21.410 --> 29:23.460
- Mother!
- Qian!

29:24.300 --> 29:25.520
Qian,

29:25.540 --> 29:26.910
I thought

29:26.930 --> 29:28.630
I'd never see you again.

29:28.650 --> 29:30.180
You look much thinner

29:30.300 --> 29:31.740
and haggard, too.

29:34.130 --> 29:35.570
Qian,

29:35.930 --> 29:37.660
how did you know I was here?

29:43.890 --> 29:45.320
Mother,

29:45.340 --> 29:46.940
what were you thinking?

29:47.300 --> 29:49.180
Why did you poison them?

29:49.860 --> 29:52.100
I wanted revenge.

29:52.620 --> 29:53.950
Back then, Su Ke was

29:53.970 --> 29:55.730
always better than me.

29:56.210 --> 29:58.950
Your grandmother incited me

29:58.970 --> 30:00.430
to compete against her.

30:00.450 --> 30:02.250
I had no choice.

30:02.450 --> 30:04.970
A while ago,

30:05.300 --> 30:07.320
Prince Yan chose Jiang Si.

30:07.340 --> 30:09.380
She'd become Princess Yan.

30:09.410 --> 30:11.660
Once they got married,

30:12.060 --> 30:13.560
our branch

30:13.580 --> 30:15.380
would be doomed.

30:15.620 --> 30:17.460
That's why I...

30:21.130 --> 30:22.940
That was terrible.

30:23.890 --> 30:24.730
We could've

30:24.730 --> 30:26.100
led a peaceful life in the mansion.

30:26.100 --> 30:27.430
Wouldn't that be nice?

30:27.450 --> 30:29.590
Why did you do things that hurt yourself

30:30.070 --> 30:30.970
and others?

30:30.970 --> 30:32.700
Well, back then...

30:33.780 --> 30:34.650
Back then?

30:34.650 --> 30:36.490
What happened?

30:37.860 --> 30:39.300
Never mind.

30:40.370 --> 30:42.080
It was a long time ago.

30:42.100 --> 30:43.540
No need to rake it up.

30:43.780 --> 30:46.770
I've reflected on myself.

30:47.260 --> 30:49.520
Given all those mistakes I made,

30:49.540 --> 30:51.900
I owe the First Branch too much.

30:52.260 --> 30:54.860
I have to pay off my debts.

30:54.970 --> 30:56.660
Please talk to your father

30:56.820 --> 30:58.900
to let me go back.

30:59.210 --> 31:01.190
I'll be their slave to...

31:01.210 --> 31:02.650
Mother,

31:03.170 --> 31:06.420
I'm afraid you can't go back.

31:06.500 --> 31:08.780
Perhaps Father is thinking about

31:08.780 --> 31:10.600
making Ms. Ruan his wife.

31:10.620 --> 31:12.330
After what happened,

31:13.370 --> 31:14.970
you're dead to him

31:15.930 --> 31:18.100
even if you're still alive.

31:20.860 --> 31:22.300
Mother!

31:30.100 --> 31:31.540
But...

31:32.500 --> 31:34.040
But in this world,

31:34.060 --> 31:35.670
where can I go

31:35.690 --> 31:37.860
except Earl Dongping's Mansion?

31:38.100 --> 31:40.140
You still have me, Mother.

31:41.100 --> 31:44.280
From now on, I'll support you.

31:44.300 --> 31:45.740
We don't need others.

31:46.210 --> 31:48.180
We'll have our own home.

31:53.820 --> 31:55.520
But Si...

31:55.540 --> 31:56.980
Don't worry.

31:57.100 --> 31:58.170
She told me to come here

31:58.170 --> 31:59.610
to get you out.

32:01.020 --> 32:02.460
I see.

32:06.500 --> 32:08.240
Rumors are spreading in the Palace

32:08.260 --> 32:09.950
that you're seductive.

32:09.970 --> 32:11.390
Who knows

32:11.410 --> 32:13.320
you're still a virgin?

32:13.340 --> 32:15.050
Neither did I know

32:15.340 --> 32:18.330
you'd be fooled by rumors, Your Highness.

32:19.820 --> 32:21.700
Some attitude you got.

32:21.860 --> 32:23.620
You're still unruly.

32:24.540 --> 32:26.280
You've scolded me

32:26.300 --> 32:27.740
and had me checked.

32:28.580 --> 32:30.280
May I go home now?

32:30.300 --> 32:31.370
This is my hall,

32:31.370 --> 32:32.670
not somewhere

32:32.690 --> 32:36.460
you can come and go as you please.

32:36.690 --> 32:37.700
Servant,

32:37.720 --> 32:39.710
fetch Important Principles for Girls.

32:40.130 --> 32:42.730
Have her copy the book until she's obedient.

32:54.820 --> 32:57.560
Has anyone in this house

32:57.580 --> 33:00.320
ever respected me at all?

33:00.340 --> 33:01.560
Who am I?

33:01.580 --> 33:03.760
Do I have a name?

33:03.780 --> 33:08.050
I'm merely your pawn!

33:09.130 --> 33:11.130
I had to compete.

33:11.130 --> 33:13.100
I had to fight

33:13.100 --> 33:14.540
in order to

33:14.540 --> 33:17.380
keep a foothold in this house!

33:18.060 --> 33:24.100
But I never meant to kill anyone.

33:24.650 --> 33:28.860
I was also tricked by others.

33:30.860 --> 33:33.080
("Time passes like running water.)

33:33.100 --> 33:35.180
(Life is as short as morning dew.")

33:35.210 --> 33:36.810
(Who knows)

33:37.020 --> 33:38.560
(my sworn enemy)

33:38.580 --> 33:40.240
(saved my life)

33:40.260 --> 33:43.390
(and gave us a way out?)

33:43.410 --> 33:44.850
(Mother, )

33:45.130 --> 33:47.380
(we'll forever remember her kindness.)

33:47.930 --> 33:48.820
(If Si needs)

33:48.820 --> 33:50.760
(our help in the future, )

33:50.780 --> 33:52.770
(we'll come back at once.)

33:58.330 --> 33:59.770
Miss Si.

34:01.810 --> 34:02.980
Since you arrived,

34:02.980 --> 34:05.310
you've had to kneel and copy the book.

34:05.330 --> 34:06.980
I feel sorry for you.

34:07.130 --> 34:09.660
Serve Miss Si tea.

34:11.730 --> 34:13.170
Thanks, Princess Qi.

34:13.330 --> 34:15.000
You've never copied this before.

34:15.020 --> 34:17.080
It takes time to learn.

34:17.100 --> 34:18.450
The first step is always difficult.

34:18.450 --> 34:19.960
I'll teach you.

34:19.980 --> 34:21.420
No, thanks.

34:29.460 --> 34:32.040
I went through the same steps the first time

34:32.060 --> 34:33.710
I paid my respects to her.

34:33.730 --> 34:35.330
When I was a girl,

34:35.420 --> 34:37.850
I was also spoiled by my parents.

34:38.020 --> 34:39.540
They always indulged me

34:39.540 --> 34:40.600
and pampered me.

34:40.620 --> 34:42.770
I had never suffered such humiliation.

34:42.900 --> 34:45.250
I cried for three days when I got back.

34:46.380 --> 34:48.330
Now, I can only hope to be

34:48.330 --> 34:50.060
a mother-in-law someday.

34:51.020 --> 34:52.040
Miss Si,

34:52.060 --> 34:54.540
you did much better than me just now.

34:54.620 --> 34:56.110
If we have each other's backs,

34:56.130 --> 34:58.250
it's better than suffering alone.

35:00.500 --> 35:02.450
You probably don't know, Princess Qi.

35:02.690 --> 35:04.480
My mother passed away a long time ago.

35:04.500 --> 35:06.000
It was my aunt

35:06.020 --> 35:07.930
who was in charge of our house.

35:07.980 --> 35:09.560
My aunt was

35:09.580 --> 35:11.180
quite pretentious.

35:11.250 --> 35:13.040
She was stingy

35:13.060 --> 35:15.310
but had to look generous.

35:15.330 --> 35:17.650
When she finally gave us a bolt of cloth

35:17.650 --> 35:18.650
and some coal,

35:18.650 --> 35:20.620
she'd go on and on about it

35:20.770 --> 35:21.980
so that everyone in town

35:21.980 --> 35:23.420
would know.

35:24.420 --> 35:26.670
What are you implying?

35:26.690 --> 35:28.310
Are you blaming me for not helping you...?

35:28.310 --> 35:29.600
I'd appreciate it if you did,

35:29.620 --> 35:31.980
but that wasn't your duty.

35:32.020 --> 35:33.060
Thank you

35:33.060 --> 35:34.230
for your tea,

35:34.250 --> 35:35.520
and thank you

35:35.540 --> 35:37.130
for putting in a good word for me

35:37.130 --> 35:38.310
with Consort Xian.

35:38.330 --> 35:40.360
But after all these years

35:40.380 --> 35:41.810
of dealing with

35:41.810 --> 35:44.230
my two-faced aunt at home,

35:44.250 --> 35:46.110
I can tell

35:46.130 --> 35:48.270
good and bad intentions.

35:48.290 --> 35:50.920
Consort Xian insulted me openly

35:50.940 --> 35:52.150
while you

35:52.170 --> 35:54.220
didn't actually respect me either.

35:54.250 --> 35:55.630
You invited me to your banquet

35:55.650 --> 35:57.750
but had me sit at the end of the table.

35:57.770 --> 35:59.270
You spoke for me

35:59.290 --> 36:01.080
only to put on a show.

36:01.100 --> 36:02.060
Such

36:02.060 --> 36:04.410
little kindness as a handout

36:04.460 --> 36:06.400
isn't any better than the cloth

36:06.420 --> 36:07.670
and coal

36:07.690 --> 36:09.410
from my aunt.

36:09.460 --> 36:12.040
If you expected to win me over

36:12.060 --> 36:13.980
with such petty favors,

36:14.540 --> 36:16.500
that'd be absurd.

36:18.460 --> 36:20.880
You mistake it, Miss Si.

36:20.900 --> 36:22.710
You just said it yourself.

36:22.730 --> 36:24.270
Now that there are two of us,

36:24.290 --> 36:25.460
you won't

36:25.460 --> 36:27.190
suffer alone.

36:27.210 --> 36:28.630
Is everything happening

36:28.650 --> 36:30.480
as you expected?

36:30.500 --> 36:32.540
I didn't know Mother

36:32.540 --> 36:34.620
- would be so mad...
- Say no more.

36:34.690 --> 36:36.960
From now on, if you don't set me up,

36:36.980 --> 36:38.600
I won't mess with you.

36:38.620 --> 36:40.060
You may leave.

36:43.130 --> 36:44.740
Good luck with the copying.

36:51.810 --> 36:53.980
Did Jiang Si really say so?

36:54.580 --> 36:56.020
Yes.

36:56.130 --> 36:58.190
I was right outside the room.

36:58.210 --> 36:59.770
I heard it loud and clear.

37:00.170 --> 37:01.020
Who gave her

37:01.020 --> 37:02.890
such a ready tongue?

37:03.900 --> 37:06.220
She barely knows Zhang's wife.

37:07.290 --> 37:08.250
Unexpectedly,

37:08.250 --> 37:10.520
she said all that I had meant to

37:10.540 --> 37:12.170
get off my chest

37:12.170 --> 37:13.890
all these years.

37:14.580 --> 37:17.220
Zhang's wife is such a hypocrite.

37:17.940 --> 37:20.710
Back then, she stood right there,

37:20.730 --> 37:23.360
keeping her head down when I lectured her.

37:23.380 --> 37:26.810
I thought she was a doormat.

37:26.900 --> 37:28.500
But once she got home,

37:28.730 --> 37:29.810
she had the Grand Preceptor

37:29.810 --> 37:31.710
complain to His Majesty about me,

37:31.730 --> 37:33.310
making me look like

37:33.330 --> 37:35.660
a mean mother-in-law.

37:37.980 --> 37:39.770
Alight then. She called me mean.

37:40.100 --> 37:41.810
I shall act accordingly.

37:48.620 --> 37:50.060
Princess Qi.

37:50.650 --> 37:52.140
Prince Yan,

37:52.730 --> 37:55.850
are you here to see Miss Si?

37:58.020 --> 37:59.580
She has

37:59.650 --> 38:00.830
suffered a lot.

38:00.850 --> 38:01.960
What happened?

38:01.980 --> 38:04.540
As obedient as Princess Qi seems,

38:04.650 --> 38:06.500
she's deep and scheming.

38:07.460 --> 38:08.560
I see

38:08.580 --> 38:11.330
that although Miss Si is unruly,

38:11.420 --> 38:13.270
she's candid and honest,

38:13.290 --> 38:15.060
not the trouble-making sort.

38:15.210 --> 38:17.600
You've kept her for too long.

38:17.620 --> 38:19.540
I wonder if Prince Yan

38:19.540 --> 38:21.290
will come to look for her.

38:21.980 --> 38:22.850
Shall I

38:22.850 --> 38:24.540
send her back now?

38:25.290 --> 38:27.400
Do you think I'm afraid of my son?

38:27.420 --> 38:29.700
You aren't, of course.

38:31.460 --> 38:34.080
Sticks always work better than carrots.

38:34.100 --> 38:35.750
I'm their mother-in-law.

38:35.770 --> 38:36.690
Whether the two of them

38:36.690 --> 38:38.600
are pretentious or stubborn,

38:38.620 --> 38:40.710
they'll have to obey me.

38:40.730 --> 38:42.000
Keep grinding her down.

38:42.020 --> 38:43.960
Your Highness, Prince Yan came.

38:43.980 --> 38:45.310
He came so soon.

38:45.330 --> 38:47.100
Have him wait outside.

38:52.100 --> 38:54.810
Consort Xian, where's Jiang Si?

39:11.770 --> 39:13.540
Have you eaten yet, Jin?

39:13.540 --> 39:16.060
Which dirty hand of yours touched her?

39:16.290 --> 39:18.060
Your Highness, I...

39:18.060 --> 39:19.500
I don't beat women.

39:19.540 --> 39:20.980
Do it yourself.

39:30.290 --> 39:31.730
Enough!

39:32.290 --> 39:33.170
She simply

39:33.170 --> 39:34.710
followed my order.

39:34.730 --> 39:37.110
Do you mean to beat me, too?

39:37.130 --> 39:39.620
All mothers-in-law train their sons' wives.

39:39.650 --> 39:41.890
The Empress Dowager trained me

39:42.060 --> 39:43.330
just like I trained

39:43.330 --> 39:45.540
your brother, Zhang's wife.

39:46.690 --> 39:48.750
Jiang Si will soon marry you.

39:48.770 --> 39:50.580
She has to be trained beforehand.

39:50.900 --> 39:52.540
After all,

39:54.170 --> 39:55.130
I'm training her

39:55.130 --> 39:56.100
for your sake.

39:56.100 --> 39:57.290
Stop saying it's for me!

39:57.290 --> 39:59.220
Did you abandon me also for my sake?

40:07.730 --> 40:09.180
Where's Jiang Si?

40:11.460 --> 40:12.900
Tell me!

40:14.290 --> 40:16.020
Please come with me.

40:21.020 --> 40:22.580
Would any mother

40:24.420 --> 40:26.330
in the world

40:27.290 --> 40:29.770
abandon her son if she had a choice?

40:45.170 --> 40:46.440
Get out.

40:46.460 --> 40:47.630
Long Dan,

40:47.650 --> 40:49.090
you too.

41:03.170 --> 41:04.770
You're breaking my heart.

41:05.380 --> 41:07.000
How come you're here already?

41:07.020 --> 41:08.360
Did everything go well?

41:08.380 --> 41:09.750
We won't come to

41:09.770 --> 41:10.730
this dump ever again!

41:10.730 --> 41:13.220
Sure. Not again.

41:14.290 --> 41:15.770
Your mother...

41:15.900 --> 41:17.340
Consort Xian.

41:18.170 --> 41:19.610
Fine, Consort Xian.

41:19.730 --> 41:22.000
We paid our respects to her today.

41:22.020 --> 41:23.560
When we visit Empress Di tomorrow,

41:23.580 --> 41:25.150
no one will suspect anything.

41:25.170 --> 41:26.610
Right?

41:27.210 --> 41:28.560
By the way,

41:28.580 --> 41:29.750
I learned

41:29.770 --> 41:31.500
that she and the Grand Princess

41:31.500 --> 41:32.920
were quite close.

41:32.940 --> 41:34.250
It was the Grand Princess

41:34.250 --> 41:36.100
who nominated her empress.

41:36.290 --> 41:37.400
In that case,

41:37.420 --> 41:38.380
could they

41:38.380 --> 41:40.140
be in cahoots?

41:44.210 --> 41:46.250
If so,

41:46.330 --> 41:48.380
it'd make sense that the Grand Princess

41:48.380 --> 41:50.020
could plant Nanwu's spies

41:50.060 --> 41:51.600
into the Changning Palace.

41:53.770 --> 41:55.960
What about the Directorate of Astronomy?

41:55.980 --> 41:58.580
Did you find the Annal hidden by my father?

42:00.250 --> 42:02.540
I was so mad that I almost forgot.

42:03.290 --> 42:05.830
(Astronomy)
"In the 3rd year of Jingming,

42:05.850 --> 42:08.270
on the 5th day of the 5th month,
the North Star shone.

42:08.290 --> 42:09.880
That was a great omen.

42:09.900 --> 42:12.440
At night, the 7th Prince was born

42:12.460 --> 42:14.830
with extraordinary fortune. He's blessed.

42:14.850 --> 42:16.750
I congratulate His Majesty

42:16.770 --> 42:19.250
(Jiang Ancheng)
on Dazhou's lasting prosperity."

42:19.620 --> 42:20.850
This is the real divination

42:20.850 --> 42:22.290
when you were born.

42:23.380 --> 42:24.500
Father once told me

42:24.520 --> 42:25.380
that such Annals

42:25.380 --> 42:27.060
were made of a special material.

42:27.060 --> 42:28.540
What's written on it can't be altered.

42:28.540 --> 42:29.790
It's credible proof.

42:29.810 --> 42:32.770
Let's present it to His Majesty.

42:33.290 --> 42:34.730
We can't!

42:34.900 --> 42:36.360
If we handed it in,

42:36.380 --> 42:37.770
the Grand Princess would go after

42:37.770 --> 42:39.210
your father first.

42:41.980 --> 42:43.730
That's why

42:43.940 --> 42:45.420
our top priority now is to find

42:45.420 --> 42:47.370
Nanwu's spies around Empress Di.

42:52.940 --> 42:54.190
The prettiest face

42:54.210 --> 42:55.830
in all of Dazhou

42:55.850 --> 42:57.700
was almost ruined!

42:59.380 --> 43:01.650
No, it's fine.

43:01.650 --> 43:03.830
They didn't slap your face

43:03.850 --> 43:05.730
but tore my heart.

43:10.280 --> 43:14.640
(The End of Episode 30)

43:15.051 --> 43:16.781
♪ From place to place ♪

43:16.781 --> 43:21.721
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

43:22.091 --> 43:24.471
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

43:24.471 --> 43:28.701
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

43:29.411 --> 43:31.811
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

43:31.831 --> 43:35.491
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:35.511 --> 43:38.931
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:39.081 --> 43:44.601
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:45.421 --> 43:49.101
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:49.101 --> 43:53.181
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:53.421 --> 43:55.161
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:55.181 --> 43:59.881
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

43:59.881 --> 44:03.451
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:03.471 --> 44:07.701
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:07.721 --> 44:09.501
♪ Time glows ♪

44:09.501 --> 44:14.041
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:14.061 --> 44:18.861
♪ And stars ♪

44:23.091 --> 44:25.621
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

44:25.641 --> 44:29.261
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

44:29.281 --> 44:32.711
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:32.731 --> 44:37.351
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:37.351 --> 44:41.041
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:41.061 --> 44:45.151
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:45.261 --> 44:47.081
♪ Time glows ♪

44:47.081 --> 44:51.631
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:51.651 --> 44:55.351
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:55.371 --> 44:59.531
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

44:59.711 --> 45:01.471
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

45:01.471 --> 45:05.991
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

45:05.991 --> 45:09.631
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

45:09.651 --> 45:15.321
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

45:17.011 --> 45:18.941
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

45:18.941 --> 45:26.441
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
